5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We should be thorough. I'll start by looking into the floor billing and the facilities quote for power.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the sound meter readings and the physio's note. I hope we can be comfortable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm curious about the morning routine upstairs and those unplanned seat shuffles. Efficiency is key for me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the badge records. Let's see who actually gets the good spots.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look at the project strands from last spring and what the new joiners reported.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
