56,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A lets us set up our chairs and avoid the noise once and for all. I vote A.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,May,,Option A saves my morning and avoids the shuffle chaos. I vote A.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A is the only way to consciously decide the seating rather than leaving it to the clock. I vote A.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think Option A will help us communicate better. I vote A.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
